<title>USA: Central CSD 22, N.M., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Central CSD 22, N.M., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $10 million of Central CSD 22, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series Feb. 15, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.23 percent.</p>
</text>
